### 服务监控（CPU / 内存 / Go 运行时 / 主机 / 磁盘）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/server
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 服务监控（认证关闭时可直接访问）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/monitor/server

### 期望响应结构
# {
#   "code": 0,
#   "msg": "success",
#   "data": {
#     "cpu":  { "cpuNum": 8, "cpuUsed": 12.34, "cpuAvg5": 0.25, "cpuAvg15": 0.50 },
#     "mem":  { "memTotal": 16000, "memUsed": 8000, "memFree": 8000, "memUsage": 50 },
#     "go":   { "goName": "GoLang", "goVersion": "go1.25.0", "goStartTime": "2024-01-01 00:00:00",
#              "goRunTime": "3小时5分钟", "goHome": "/usr/local/go", "goUserDir": "/",
#              "goTotal": 20, "goUsed": 12, "goFree": 8, "goUsage": 60 },
#     "sys":  { "sysComputerName": "mint223", "sysComputerIp": "192.168.122.129",
#              "sysOsName": "Ubuntu 22.04.3 LTS", "sysOsArch": "amd64" },
#     "sysFiles": [
#       { "dirName": "/", "sysTypeName": "overlay", "typeName": "本地磁盘",
#         "total": 40000, "free": 20000, "used": 20000, "usage": 50 }
#     ]
#   }
# }
#
# 说明：
# - CPU/内存/磁盘仅 Linux 平台采集（读取 /proc），其它平台返回零值，Go 运行时与主机信息各平台均可返回
# - 单位均为 MB，使用率单位为 %
